<title>UK: DSL Finance sets 1.0 bln mark 12-year bond, +32 bp. [CORRECTED 12:17 GMT]</title>
<headline>DSL Finance sets 1.0 bln mark 12-year bond, +32 bp. [CORRECTED 12:17 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    19.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 GOV LAW    GERMAN    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p>(Corrects rating agency from Standard &amp; Poor's to IBCA.)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  2.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
